379
00:15:49,448 --> 00:15:51,867
-[Matt] 2.9...
-Yeah, it's obviously up to you.

380
00:15:51,950 --> 00:15:54,870
But my suggestion is not to take it.

381
00:15:54,954 --> 00:15:56,789
