I just don't wanna wait.

384
00:16:03,045 --> 00:16:04,588
[Mary] Okay. I'm on it.

385
00:16:04,672 --> 00:16:06,507
-[Matt] Okay. Thanks, Mary.
-Thanks, bye.

386
00:16:06,590 --> 00:16:07,424
[Matt] Bye.

387
00:16:08,217 --> 00:16:09,760
-[Mary] Guys...
-[Jason] How'd that go?

388
00:16:10,678 --> 00:16:12,054
[Mary] Yeah, it went okay.

389
00:16:12,137 --> 00:16:13,973
