396
00:16:28,612 --> 00:16:29,446
I mean...

397
00:16:31,657 --> 00:16:33,951
-What's going on?
-I'm fuming.

398
00:16:34,410 --> 00:16:36,996
His client came in and wrote a low offer,

399
00:16:37,079 --> 00:16:40,332
so now I'm like struggling to
make sure my clients don't lose money.

400
00:16:40,416 --> 00:16:41,250
-[Jason] Mary?
-What?

401
00:16:41,333 --> 00:16:43,002
My clients really want an answer.

402
00:16:43,085 --> 00:16:45,337
Jason, you're being a dick right now.

403
00:16:45,421 --> 00:16:48,090
-It's been like 10 minutes.
-[Jason] Is he gonna take it or not?

404
00:16:48,590 --> 00:16:50,134
We will give you an answer.

405
00:16:50,217 --> 00:16:52,177
I just think you're being dismissive
about a good offer.

406
00:16:52,261 --> 00:16:55,681
I'm not being dismissive.
I submitted it to them.

407
00:16:55,764 --> 00:16:57,516
And I gave them my professional opinion.

408
00:16:57,975 --> 00:17:01,645
They can do what they want,
but it's 300,000 less than we're asking.

409
00:17:01,729 --> 00:17:03,605
A lot of homes sell for 300,000 less.

410
00:17:03,689 --> 00:17:05,441
But it's new construction,
it was priced well.

411
00:17:05,524 --> 00:17:08,610
If it sits on the market more,
he won't even get 2.9 again.

412
00:17:08,694 --> 00:17:09,945
They're thinking it over

413
00:17:10,029 --> 00:17:12,781
and allowing me to get them
a better offer in the meantime.

414
00:17:12,865 --> 00:17:14,616
My clients can pull their offer 
at any time.

415
00:17:14,700 --> 00:17:16,076
It's a shitty offer. Pull it.

416
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:18,078
-[Jason] It's not a shitty offer.
-Yeah, it is.

417
00:17:18,620 --> 00:17:21,540
-[Jason] You don't have any other offers.
-I don't have written offers,

418
00:17:21,623 --> 00:17:23,417
but I have other very interested buyers.

419
00:17:23,500 --> 00:17:25,794
All these other interested buyers,
have you called them?

420
00:17:26,086 --> 00:17:29,089
I... I am if he stops talking to me.

421
00:17:29,631 --> 00:17:31,133
Well, I would like an answer.

422
00:17:38,182 --> 00:17:39,808
♪ The flame is burning ♪

423
00:17:43,896 --> 00:17:45,439
♪ The flame is burning ♪

424
00:17:45,522 --> 00:17:49,193
♪ Don't wanna let this go ♪

425
00:17:50,277 --> 00:17:54,615
♪ Fly, fly high ♪

426
