427
00:17:57,951 --> 00:17:59,745
-Oh, wow.
-It was one of those nights.

428
00:17:59,828 --> 00:18:03,457
-[Maya] I miss that.
-Thank you so much. Thank you.

429
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:05,417
