433
00:18:11,381 --> 00:18:13,091
-[server] French toast?
-[Maya] For me.

434
00:18:13,175 --> 00:18:14,968
-Thank you.
-[Christine] That smells so good.

435
00:18:15,052 --> 00:18:17,262
-[Maya] Eat.
-I can't. I just put my lip ointment on.

436
00:18:18,055 --> 00:18:20,265
So, the engagement party was...

437
00:18:20,599 --> 00:18:22,851
-It was so-- It was a beautiful event.
-Awkward.

438
00:18:22,935 --> 00:18:25,270
-Well, duh, it was gorgeous.
-Besides...

439
00:18:25,354 --> 00:18:27,481
But Romain seemed super heated.

440
00:18:28,315 --> 00:18:30,400
-It was weird--
-[Maya] I talked to him.

441
00:18:30,484 --> 00:18:33,779
Like, "You think you're gonna move on
and forget this?"

442
00:18:33,862 --> 00:18:34,863
He's like, "No..."

443
00:18:34,947 --> 00:18:36,240
He was very stubborn.

444
00:18:37,866 --> 00:18:40,619
The thing is, it's not about me,
it sucks for him.

445
00:18:40,702 --> 00:18:42,538
Like, it's not healthy for him, you know?

446
00:18:42,621 --> 00:18:44,665
