he was upset about it.

447
00:18:44,748 --> 00:18:45,707
I didn't either.

448
00:18:46,333 --> 00:18:49,128
I never realized he was 
this fucking hypersensitive.

449
00:18:49,211 --> 00:18:51,380
If he's taking his anger out 
on me a year later,

450
00:18:51,463 --> 00:18:52,673
it doesn't make any sense.

451
00:18:52,756 --> 00:18:54,258
Like, why are you still this mad?

452
00:18:54,341 --> 00:18:56,718
I was more offended 
