461
00:19:13,068 --> 00:19:14,778
Hopefully, obviously, 
I'm sure you meant it,

462
00:19:14,862 --> 00:19:16,947
so what else can you do, right?

463
00:19:17,030 --> 00:19:21,118
And like, I'm not gonna beg
on the floor and kiss your feet.

464
00:19:21,243 --> 00:19:22,870
-Like, that's it.
-At that point

465
00:19:22,953 --> 00:19:25,372
